{"id":"vod_sn_38578","vodId":"38578","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"山田君与7个魔女","name_cn":"山田君与7个魔女","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/cc7459783c3b64c03940b5bbd415dc43.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在私立朱雀高校之中，山田龙（逢坂良太 配音）是校园中有名的不良少年，同学老师们看见他恨不得绕着道走，而山田龙本人亦对无聊束缚的校园生活深恶痛绝。某日，一场意外竟然让他和优等生白石丽（早见沙织 配音）互换了身体，因而得知了白石丽隐藏在内心里的秘密，并在同级生宫村虎之介（增田俊树 配音）的唆使之下加入了超自然研究部。　　同为部员的还有对超自然事件超级着迷的伊藤雅（内田真礼 配音）和不良少年椿剑太郎（佐佐木寿治 配音）。几人受腹黑的学生会会长山崎春马（福山润 配音）之命调查校园中存在魔女的事件，就此打开了新世界的大门。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FHSw19y8ch1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J3RC82m06R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wXm8dzFKwF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BmAkx4zu7D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VwfDGkTHzm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TkXMEC7iTW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PkbeLfjyA31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FSxYacQ9ug1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jXfDqmvm321/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jXDYSyfNLa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N426CVWd471/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BEJw8Ui1un1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q8PhW2JETQ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:57.113Z"}